---
<Lesson
	titlePt={titlePt}
	titleEn={titleEn}
	titleFallback={titleFallback}
	bodyClass={bodyClass}
	viewport={viewport}
	assets={assets}
>
	<Fragment is:raw>
    <article class="lesson">
      <header class="hero">
        <span class="eyebrow"
          ><span data-lang="pt">⬡ System Design · Fundamentos</span
          ><span data-lang="en">⬡ System Design · Fundamentals</span></span
        >
        <h1>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Dimensione com números redondos,<br />não com palpites.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Size it with round numbers,<br />not guesses.</span
          >
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Antes de escolher tecnologia, estime a escala:
            <strong>tráfego, banda, armazenamento</strong>. Números arredondados
            bastam para decidir se você precisa de cache, de shard ou de nada
            disso. Esta lição fixa a <em>tabela de latências</em> e o reflexo do
            back-of-envelope.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Before picking a technology, estimate the scale:
            <strong>traffic, bandwidth, storage</strong>. Round numbers are
            enough to decide whether you need a cache, a shard, or none of it.
            This lesson locks in the <em>latency table</em> and the
            back-of-envelope reflex.</span
          >
        </p>
        <p class="lesson-nav-top">
          ↑ <a href="../MISSION.md">System Design</a> ·
          <span data-lang="pt">anterior</span><span data-lang="en">prev</span>:
          <a href="./0002-the-four-forces.html"
            ><span data-lang="pt">As quatro forças</span
            ><span data-lang="en">The four forces</span></a
          >
          · <span data-lang="pt">próxima</span><span data-lang="en">next</span>:
          <em
            ><span data-lang="pt">Estado e limites</span
            ><span data-lang="en">State &amp; boundaries</span></em
          >
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- ============ 1. CONSTANTS + LATENCY LADDER ============ -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">1</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">As constantes que você decora</span
        ><span data-lang="en">The constants you memorize</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Estimativa boa = números que cabem na cabeça. Decore duas coisas: as
          <em>potências de 10</em> (bytes e tempo) e a
          <em>escada de latências</em> — quão rápido cada bloco responde.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >A good estimate = numbers that fit in your head. Memorize two things:
          the <em>powers of 10</em> (bytes and time) and the
          <em>latency ladder</em> — how fast each block responds.</span
        >
      </p>

      <pre
        class="block"
      ><span class="c"><span data-lang="pt"># Constantes para levar na cabeça</span><span data-lang="en"># Constants to carry in your head</span></span>
1 KB = 10³ B   ·   1 MB = 10⁶ B   ·   1 GB = 10⁹ B
1 TB = 10¹² B  ·   1 PB = 10¹⁵ B
<span data-lang="pt">1 dia ≈ 86 400 s ≈ 10⁵ s      1 ano ≈ 3,15 × 10⁷ s (≈ 31,5 M)</span><span data-lang="en">1 day ≈ 86,400 s ≈ 10⁵ s     1 year ≈ 3.15 × 10⁷ s (≈ 31.5 M)</span></pre>

      <p class="kicker" style="margin-top: 18px">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Agora a escada. Cada degrau é ~10× mais lento que o anterior —
          memorize a <em>ordem de grandeza</em>, não os dígitos exatos.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Now the ladder. Each rung is ~10× slower than the one before —
          memorize the <em>order of magnitude</em>, not the exact digits.</span
        >
      </p>

      <div class="scroll-x" style="margin: 22px 0 8px">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 720 348"
          width="100%"
          style="min-width: 720px"
          role="img"
          aria-labelledby="ll-title"
        >
          <title
            id="ll-title"
            data-pt="Escada de latências em escala logarítmica"
            data-en="Latency ladder on a log scale"
          >
            Escada de latências em escala logarítmica
          </title>

          <text
            x="104"
            y="22"
            font-family="Space Grotesk"
            font-size="11"
            font-weight="700"
            fill="#8b6ff7"
            data-pt="escala log · latência"
            data-en="log scale · latency"
          >
            escala log · latência
          </text>

          <!-- decade gridlines: 1ns 1µs 1ms 100ms 1s -->
          <g
            stroke="#3a3f55"
            stroke-width="1"
            stroke-dasharray="2 5"
            opacity=".55"
          >
            <line x1="130" y1="30" x2="130" y2="284" />
            <line x1="317" y1="30" x2="317" y2="284" />
            <line x1="504" y1="30" x2="504" y2="284" />
            <line x1="628" y1="30" x2="628" y2="284" />
            <line x1="690" y1="30" x2="690" y2="284" />
          </g>

          <!-- bars (length = log of latency; gutter starts at x=104) -->
          <rect x="104" y="34" width="26" height="24" rx="4" fill="#2dd4bf" />
          <rect x="104" y="76" width="150" height="24" rx="4" fill="#2dd4bf" />
          <rect x="104" y="118" width="337" height="24" rx="4" fill="#8b6ff7" />
          <rect x="104" y="160" width="381" height="24" rx="4" fill="#8b6ff7" />
          <rect x="104" y="202" width="461" height="24" rx="4" fill="#fbbf24" />
          <rect x="104" y="244" width="524" height="24" rx="4" fill="#fb7185" />

          <!-- rung names (left) -->
          <g
            font-family="Inter"
            font-size="11.5"
            font-weight="700"
            fill="#eceef6"
            text-anchor="end"
          >
            <text x="98" y="50" data-pt="L1 (cache)" data-en="L1 (cache)">
              L1 (cache)
            </text>
            <text x="98" y="92" data-pt="Memória" data-en="Memory">
              Memória
            </text>
            <text x="98" y="134" data-pt="Leitura SSD" data-en="SSD read">
              Leitura SSD
            </text>
            <text x="98" y="176" data-pt="Rede no DC" data-en="DC network">
              Rede no DC
            </text>
            <text x="98" y="218" data-pt="Seek HDD" data-en="HDD seek">
              Seek HDD
            </text>
            <text
              x="98"
              y="260"
              data-pt="WAN (inter-região)"
              data-en="WAN (cross-region)"
            >
              WAN (inter-região)
            </text>
          </g>

          <!-- values (right of bars) -->
          <g font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10.5" fill="#eceef6">
            <text x="136" y="50" data-pt="~1 ns" data-en="~1 ns">~1 ns</text>
            <text x="260" y="92" data-pt="~100 ns" data-en="~100 ns">
              ~100 ns
            </text>
            <text
              x="447"
              y="134"
              data-pt="~100 µs (0,1 ms)"
              data-en="~100 µs (0.1 ms)"
            >
              ~100 µs (0,1 ms)
            </text>
            <text x="491" y="176" data-pt="~0,5 ms" data-en="~0.5 ms">
              ~0,5 ms
            </text>
            <text x="571" y="218" data-pt="~10 ms" data-en="~10 ms">
              ~10 ms
            </text>
            <text x="634" y="260" data-pt="~50–150 ms" data-en="~50–150 ms">
              ~50–150 ms
            </text>
          </g>

          <!-- log axis -->
          <line
            x1="104"
            y1="284"
            x2="690"
            y2="284"
            stroke="#3a3f55"
            stroke-width="1.5"
          />
          <g
            font-family="Inter"
            font-size="10"
            fill="#9ea2b8"
            text-anchor="middle"
          >
            <text x="130" y="300" data-pt="1 ns" data-en="1 ns">1 ns</text>
            <text x="317" y="300" data-pt="1 µs" data-en="1 µs">1 µs</text>
            <text x="504" y="300" data-pt="1 ms" data-en="1 ms">1 ms</text>
            <text x="628" y="300" data-pt="100 ms" data-en="100 ms">
              100 ms
            </text>
            <text x="690" y="300" data-pt="1 s" data-en="1 s">1 s</text>
          </g>
          <text
            x="397"
            y="326"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="Inter"
            font-size="10.5"
            fill="#9ea2b8"
            data-pt="cada grade ≈ ×10 — de L1 a WAN são ~8 décadas (10⁸×)"
            data-en="each gridline ≈ ×10 — L1 to WAN span ~8 decades (10⁸×)"
          >
            cada grade ≈ ×10 — de L1 a WAN são ~8 décadas (10⁸×)
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="cite">
        <span data-lang="pt">Fonte:</span><span data-lang="en">Source:</span>
        <a
          href="https://colin-scott.github.io/personal_website/research/latency_trends.html"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >Latency Numbers Every Programmer Should Know</a
        >
        — <span data-lang="pt">a tabela canônica de L1 a rede.</span
        ><span data-lang="en">the canonical table from L1 to network.</span>
      </p>

      <!-- ============ 2. THE METHOD ============ -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">2</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">O método: back-of-envelope em 4 passos</span
        ><span data-lang="en">The method: back-of-envelope in 4 steps</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Sempre a mesma sequência. O erro nº 1 é citar uma tecnologia antes de
          ter um número.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Always the same sequence. The #1 mistake is naming a technology
          before you have a number.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top: 14px">
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #2dd4bf">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">1 · Assuma</span
            ><span data-lang="en">1 · Assume</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Declare as premissas: usuários, payload, proporção
              leitura/escrita, retenção. Diga em voz alta.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >State the assumptions: users, payload, read/write ratio,
              retention. Say them out loud.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #8b6ff7">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">2 · Arredonde</span
            ><span data-lang="en">2 · Round</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Use potências de 10. 86 400 s ≈ 10⁵ s; 31,5 M ≈ 10⁷·⁵ s.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Use powers of 10. 86,400 s ≈ 10⁵ s; 31.5 M ≈ 10⁷·⁵ s.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #8b6ff7">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">3 · Por segundo</span
            ><span data-lang="en">3 · Per second</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Total diário ÷ ~10⁵ s dá a taxa média. Pico ≈ 2–10× a média —
              dimensione para o pico.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Daily total ÷ ~10⁵ s gives the average rate. Peak ≈ 2–10× the
              average — size for the peak.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #fb7185">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">4 · Multiplique</span
            ><span data-lang="en">4 · Multiply</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >payload × QPS = banda; taxa × payload × retenção =
              armazenamento.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >payload × QPS = bandwidth; rate × payload × retention =
              storage.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ 3. WORKED EXAMPLE ============ -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">3</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Exemplo aplicado: app de chat</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Worked example: chat app</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Cada linha é um passo do método. Os números decidem os blocos antes
          de você tocar numa tecnologia.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Each line is one step of the method. The numbers decide the blocks
          before you touch any technology.</span
        >
      </p>

      <pre
        class="block"
      ><span class="c"><span data-lang="pt"># App de chat — 50M usuários · 40 msgs/usuário/dia · 100 B/msg · reter 1 ano</span><span data-lang="en"># Chat app — 50M users · 40 msgs/user/day · 100 B/msg · retain 1 year</span></span>
<span data-lang="pt">msgs/dia    = 50M × 40          = 2 B</span><span data-lang="en">msgs/day    = 50M × 40          = 2 B</span>
<span data-lang="pt">msgs/s      ≈ 2B ÷ 10⁵          ≈ 20k/s   (pico ×3 ≈ 60k/s)</span><span data-lang="en">msgs/s      ≈ 2B ÷ 10⁵          ≈ 20k/s   (peak ×3 ≈ 60k/s)</span>
<span data-lang="pt">armaz./ano  = 2B × 100 B × 365  ≈ 73 TB</span><span data-lang="en">storage/yr  = 2B × 100 B × 365  ≈ 73 TB</span>
<span data-lang="pt">banda       ≈ 20k/s × 100 B     ≈ 2 MB/s</span><span data-lang="en">bandwidth   ≈ 20k/s × 100 B     ≈ 2 MB/s</span></pre>

      <p class="cite">
        <span data-lang="pt">Estrutura de “escalabilidade” em</span
        ><span data-lang="en">"Scalability" framing in</span>
        <a href="https://dataintensive.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >DDIA cap. 1</a
        >
        —
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >descrever a carga, depois medir desempenho sob essa carga.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >describe the load, then measure performance under that load.</span
        >
      </p>

      <!-- ============ 4. RULES OF THUMB ============ -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">4</span><span data-lang="pt">Regras de ouro</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Rules of thumb</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Dois atalhos conectam os números às decisões de arquitetura.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Two shortcuts connect the numbers to architecture decisions.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top: 14px">
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #2dd4bf">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">leitura/escrita → cache</span
            ><span data-lang="en">read/write → cache</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >A proporção leitura:escrita guia o cache. Muita leitura → cache
              agressivo no caminho de leitura.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >The read:write ratio drives caching. Read-heavy → an aggressive
              cache on the read path.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #fbbf24">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >crescimento = escrita × payload × retenção</span
            ><span data-lang="en">growth = writes × payload × retention</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >O armazenamento cresce pela taxa de escrita. Defina a retenção
              antes de escolher o banco.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Storage grows with the write rate. Set the retention before you
              choose the store.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout tip">
        <p>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>Reflexo:</strong> ao ouvir “50M usuários”, converta
            mentalmente para QPS e banda antes de falar em tecnologia. Quem fala
            número primeiro, ganha a entrevista.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>Reflex:</strong> when you hear "50M users", mentally
            convert to QPS and bandwidth before naming a tech. Whoever speaks a
            number first, wins the interview.</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ 5. QUIZ ============ -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">★</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">🧠 Calculadora: back-of-envelope</span
        ><span data-lang="en">🧠 Calculator: back-of-envelope</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="ex calc" id="ex-boe">
        <div class="calc-grid">
          <label
            ><span data-lang="pt">Usuários</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Users</span>
            <input type="number" id="b-u" value="50000000"
          /></label>
          <label
            ><span data-lang="pt">Ações/usuário/dia</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Actions/user/day</span>
            <input type="number" id="b-a" value="40"
          /></label>
          <label
            ><span data-lang="pt">Payload (bytes)</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Payload (bytes)</span>
            <input type="number" id="b-p" value="100"
          /></label>
          <label
            ><span data-lang="pt">Retenção (dias)</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Retention (days)</span>
            <input type="number" id="b-r" value="365"
          /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-out">
          <div>
            <span data-lang="pt">Eventos / dia:</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Events / day:</span> <b id="bo-eday"></b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span data-lang="pt">Eventos / s (média):</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Events / s (avg):</span> <b id="bo-eps"></b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span data-lang="pt">Eventos / s (pico ≈3×):</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Events / s (peak ≈3×):</span>
            <b id="bo-peak"></b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span data-lang="pt">Armazenamento (retido):</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Storage (retained):</span> <b id="bo-st"></b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span data-lang="pt">Banda (média):</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Bandwidth (avg):</span> <b id="bo-bw"></b>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <script>
        (function () {
          const U = document.getElementById("b-u"),
            A = document.getElementById("b-a"),
            P = document.getElementById("b-p"),
            R = document.getElementById("b-r");
          const ed = document.getElementById("bo-eday"),
            ep = document.getElementById("bo-eps"),
            pk = document.getElementById("bo-peak"),
            st = document.getElementById("bo-st"),
            bw = document.getElementById("bo-bw");
          const cnt = (n) =>
            n >= 1e9
              ? (n / 1e9).toFixed(2) + "B"
              : n >= 1e6
                ? (n / 1e6).toFixed(2) + "M"
                : n >= 1e3
                  ? (n / 1e3).toFixed(1) + "k"
                  : String(Math.round(n));
          const hb = (n) => {
            const u = ["B", "KB", "MB", "GB", "TB", "PB"];
            let i = 0;
            while (n >= 1024 && i < u.length - 1) {
              n /= 1024;
              i++;
            }
            return n.toFixed(n >= 100 ? 0 : 1) + " " + u[i] + "/s";
          };
          const hb2 = (n) => hb(n).replace("/s", "");
          function compute() {
            const u = parseFloat(U.value) || 0,
              a = parseFloat(A.value) || 0,
              p = parseFloat(P.value) || 0,
              r = parseFloat(R.value) || 0;
            const eday = u * a,
              eps = eday / 86400;
            ed.textContent = cnt(eday);
            ep.textContent = cnt(eps) + "/s";
            pk.textContent = cnt(eps * 3) + "/s";
            st.textContent = hb2(eday * p * r);
            bw.textContent = hb(eps * p);
          }
          [U, A, P, R].forEach((el) => el.addEventListener("input", compute));
          compute();
        })();
      </script>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">5</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Confira o modelo mental</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Check the mental model</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="quiz" id="q1" role="group" aria-labelledby="q1l">
        <div class="q" id="q1l">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Q1. Leitura SSD (~100 µs) é, na ordem de grandeza, quanto mais
            lenta que a memória (~100 ns)?</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Q1. SSD read (~100 µs) is roughly how much slower than main memory
            (~100 ns)?</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="options">
          <button
            class="opt"
            data-correct="true"
            data-fb-pt="Exato: 100 µs ÷ 100 ns = 1000× — três décadas."
            data-fb-en="Exact: 100 µs ÷ 100 ns = 1000× — three decades."
          >
            <span data-lang="pt">~1000× mais lenta</span
            ><span data-lang="en">~1000× slower</span>
          </button>
          <button
            class="opt"
            data-correct="false"
            data-fb-pt="Não: 100 µs vs 100 ns são ×1000, não ×10."
            data-fb-en="No: 100 µs vs 100 ns is ×1000, not ×10."
          >
            <span data-lang="pt">~10× mais lenta</span
            ><span data-lang="en">~10× slower</span>
          </button>
          <button
            class="opt"
            data-correct="false"
            data-fb-pt="Não: µs é 1000× maior que ns — ordens de grandeza."
            data-fb-en="No: µs is 1000× larger than ns — orders of magnitude."
          >
            <span data-lang="pt">~igual (1×)</span
            ><span data-lang="en">~equal (1×)</span>
          </button>
          <button
            class="opt"
            data-correct="false"
            data-fb-pt="Não: isso seriam seis décadas; aqui são três."
            data-fb-en="No: that's six decades; here it's three."
          >
            <span data-lang="pt">~1 000 000× mais lenta</span
            ><span data-lang="en">~1,000,000× slower</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="verdict" aria-live="polite"></div>
